-- 644_camera_spots_reworded: location spots written as a camera direction ("Low angle up at ...", "Wide pull-back
-- across ...", "medium view of ...") reworded into place phrasing, keeping their content, scale and pool slot
-- (NIGHTLY_POOL_CLEANUP_PLAN.md phase 4 step 3; Kevin 2026-09-30: reword, don't deactivate). The engine's look fragment
-- owns framing and flux ignores camera-distance words, so the camera words only crowded out the place.
-- scripts/reword-camera-spots.js drafted 218 rewordings, each reviewed (17 hand-fixed; 4 more spots skipped
-- because mig 643 switched them off). Guarded: only rows whose text is still the reviewed original, and never onto a
-- text the same card already has ((location_key, spot_text) is UNIQUE). Re-runnable.

